      "value": "update:\n\nThe new 3rd person beta [build number 1770] has a different behevior.\n\nhere are the new tabs only being affected:\n\nworld left side menu\n\nkeyboard on world search\n\n3D avatar preview in avatars tab\n\nVRC+ 2025 holiday event",
