  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Some UI elements like the keyboard icon in the world search bar and most of the text box background on user profile windows will have the camera render preview window in VR render over them.\n\nThe behevior is observed on the current open beta (build 1766 ) and the current live branch on steam (build 1750)\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Open Camera\n\n3. Open Menu\n\n4. Go to worlds tab\n\n5. Go to a user profile tab\n\nVideo showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/YLjCUQr0-3I",
